# The Alraune (mandragora) is one for both players: pulled from the ground by one, the plant is gone for the other and
# the fleeing creature is out in both worlds; caught by one, it is gone for both.
#
# Spot PickUp_Alraune at (6223,-477), Scene_Creatures. Hero 5 slot 0 (the default session save).

include session.coop

# The swamp around the spot downs a fresh hero in seconds, and two players down is a lost run: kept standing.
A run invincibility
B run invincibility
A tp 6180,-477
B tp 6160,-460
sleep 6
A expect interactables Alraune contains Interact_Alraune timeout=15
B expect interactables Alraune contains Interact_Alraune timeout=15
A counter worldsent
B counter worldapplied

# ---- Pulled by the host: the plant goes for the client too, and the creature is out in both worlds. ----
A expect use Interact_Alraune 300 contains used timeout=15
sleep 6
# By name, wherever it fled to.
A expect ai Alraune contains dead=0 timeout=15
B expect counter worldapplied >= 1 timeout=20
B expect interactables Alraune !contains Interact_Alraune timeout=10
B expect ai Alraune contains dead=0 timeout=15
# One creature, driven by the host: both worlds put it in the same place.
sleep 3
A ai Alraune
B ai Alraune

# ---- Caught by the host: its dialogue ends with the creature gone, in both worlds. ----
A expect talk Alraune DT_Main_Alraune contains talking timeout=20
A skip first
A expect dialogue contains "in=0" timeout=60
A itemsearch alraune
A inventory alraune
A expect actors 2000 !contains Alraune timeout=15
B expect actors 2000 !contains Alraune timeout=20
